{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[00:19.26] Compromised Lyrics\n[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:21.46] Mmmm, mm\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:28.14] Every day I wake up, get to the cake\n[00:29.84] Rainy or sunny, it's money to make\n[00:31.48] If I'm down bad, it’s just too bad\n[00:33.42] Hands in the air, all your money I'll take\n[00:34.92] Sittin' up in the trap with a safe like a bank\n[00:36.74] Didn't believe in me, niggas was saying I can't\n[00:38.62] Now I'm riding in a Hellcat, matte black paint\n[00:40.38] Move it slow like a snail in a Lambo race\n[00:42.36] Speed it up, speed it up, change the pace\n[00:44.14] Drown in lean and smoke the dank\n[00:45.92] My weed stank, it'll make you faint\n[00:47.58] Yo' nigga a joke, he a hoax and a prank\n[00:49.26] He get shot in the throat if you get in the way, hey\n[00:51.62] No hesitation, I don't blink, hey\n[00:53.60] It's gettin' cold outside, hey\n[00:55.34] So I went out and bought me a mink, let's go!\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:57.18] All my niggas gon' ride (Hey)\n[00:59.00] All my niggas gon' slide (Okay)\n[01:00.68] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide\n[01:03.58] Hit him with the .9, knock him down to size (Fuck)\n[01:08.08] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)\n[01:11.50] All my niggas gon' ride (Yeah)\n[01:13.34] All my niggas gon' slide (Grrt, yeah)\n[01:15.10] For me, they would die (Oh yeah), even if I ain't provide\n[01:18.64] Hit him with the .9 (Brr, brr), knock him down to size (Brr, fuck)\n[01:21.54] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)\n[Verse 2: Ski Mask The Slump God]\n[01:25.92] All of these niggas (Yuh), all of these bitches (Yuh)\n[01:29.40] Bug me like critters (Yuh), whip cocoon, caterpillars (Yuh, yuh)\n[01:32.76] You a Jake like where Finn is, (Yuh) sippin' purple, no Grimace (Yeah)\n[01:36.26] Couple racks on me like I play tennis, not vegan, got carrots and lettuce (Yuh, yuh)\n[01:40.22] All of my niggas is gone, all of your niggas is gone\n[01:43.50] Make him pickup like \"Answer the phone\" (Yeah), like an alarm, bitch, I'm settin' the tone (Yuh)\n[01:47.18] PJ to Chicago for linens, (Yuh) you'll never catch me out at Lenox\n[01:50.78] You niggas see through just like linens\n[01:52.10] Keep a .40 inside of my denim (Inside of my denim)\n[Verse 3: Juice WRLD]\n[01:54.22] I roll with G-Money we getting the millions\n[02:00.84] The sky is the limit, I don't got no limits\n[02:02.42] Gang, gang, gang, gang, bitch, I'm No Limit\n[02:03.32] I don't wanna drink sprite if it ain't got a four in\n[02:04.62] I ain't hop in the car, if it don't got a pole in it\n[02:05.84] PJ to the A, I'ma buy new linens\n[02:06.58] Mansion in Atlanta just for Christmas\n[02:07.58] Kel-Tec and some Hi-Tec on my wishlist\n[02:08.52] I get high and tell all my demons \"Go away\"\n[02:10.36] Diamonds on me, that's why I'm frozen in the rain\n[02:12.20] I be fly as a superhero with a cape\n[02:13.98] All my hoodies orangutan, yeah, they Bape\n[02:15.54] Poppin' wheelies on four wheelers, do a scrape\n[02:17.52] While G-Money go one-twenty in a straight\n[02:19.38] We get money like three hundred for the stage\n[02:21.10] Yeah, I run it, got my lyrics in their brain\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[02:30.32] All my niggas gon' ride\n[02:32.12] All my niggas gon' slide\n[02:33.84] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide\n[02:37.36] Hit him with the .9 knock him down to size (Fuck)\n[02:41.46] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass, a compromised (Let's go)\n[02:44.74] All my niggas gon' ride (Yeah)\n[02:46.46] All my niggas gon' slide (Brr, yeah)\n[02:50.62] For me, they would die (Oh yeah), even if I ain't provide\n[03:00.30] Hit him with the .9 (Brr, brr), knock him down to size (Brr, fuck)\n[03:04.64] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised","words":[[14.14,14.32,"[Intro:"],[14.58,14.74,"Juice"],[14.84,15.04,"WRLD]"],[21.46,21.62,"Mmmm,"],[21.8,21.84,"mm"],[21.88,21.98,"[Verse"],[22.0,22.02,"1: